1
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,280
My Lady, you've been gone so long.

4
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:46,000
I've come to welcome you home.

5
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,040
What's so urgent?

6
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,920
The silkworm house
has been fully thatched.

7
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,520
We're all waiting for you to return.

8
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:54,120
By custom, the owner must be the first
to enter a newly built house.

9
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:57,720
Look out!

10
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,520
Protect Her Ladyship!

11
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,160
Go! Now!

12
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:17,280
Your Ladyship, you promised me.

13
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,800
You said you'd forgiven me.

14
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:23,600
I haven't. I hold grudges.

15
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,680
You have to keep being good to me.

16
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,000
You have to stay by my side.

17
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,640
Only then will I forgive you.

18
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:29,760
Bitao…

19
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:36,080
You've suffered so much, My Lady.

20
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:39,080
So much.

21
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:45,680
Your adoptive mother, your birth mother,
and the Wei family.

22
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:48,160
They've all been so cruel to you.

23
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:53,240
And so have I.

24
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:58,400
For my own selfish reasons,
I betrayed you.

25
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,640
No, you didn't, Bitao.

26
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:03,000
You're different. You're not like them.

27
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:07,680
Those people never treated us as human.

28
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:15,880
Every time I saw you win,
it felt so, so good.

29
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:27,120
Don't look back. Keep climbing.

30
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:30,000
Fight your way to the top.

31
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:39,680
Everyone who's mocked you
will one day grovel at your feet.

32
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,360
I will.

33
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:45,040
No one can stand in your way.

34
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:50,240
I can't bear to go.

35
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,560
I wanted to see it for myself.

36
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:55,200
To see your future…

37
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:58,480
- Your future…
- I'll make it happen. I will.

38
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:07,720
Bitao…

39
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,280
Bitao.

40
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,480
Bitao!

41
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:21,840
Bitao.

42
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,920
Bitao.

43
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,960
- Bitao…
- Rao!

44
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,040
- My lady.
- Bitao!

45
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,400
Your Ladyship.

46
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,360
Bitao!

47
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:47,640
Bitao!

48
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:08,920
ZHUYU ESTATE

49
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,600
<i>My Lady, you've been gone so long.</i>

50
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,480
<i>I've come to welcome you home.</i>

51
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,040
Bitao!

52
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:25,840
Wei Rao, you're awake.

53
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,280
Those bandits…

54
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,280
- Have they been caught?
- We caught them all.

55
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:34,000
We used severe measures. They confessed
as bandits from the South Mountain

56
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,960
who had come seeking revenge.

57
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,880
I've sent men to escort
the Fourth Prince back to the palace.

58
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,320
As for your maid,

59
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,000
I've had someone arrange her funeral.

60
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,080
Thank you, General Qi.

61
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,920
Wei Rao, in fact…

62
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,160
General Qi, I'd like some time alone.

63
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,120
I'll leave you, then.

64
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:05,280
If you need anything, let me know.

65
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,200
You two may leave too.

66
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,560
‪ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

67
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,680
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

68
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,400
Has Her Ladyship stayed
in her room all this time?

69
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:38,159
She won't come out or see any visitors.

70
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,799
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

71
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,000
You saw it yourself.

72
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,720
She even turned away Lady Li's people.

73
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:44,760
No matter what we say,
she refuses to see anyone.

74
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,640
What do we do?

75
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,120
I'll make her want
to come out of that room.

76
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,160
Hurry!

77
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,920
At this time of year,
there's plenty to do on the estate.

78
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:24,200
- How can you hide in here, lazing about?
- Grandmother, what brings you here?

79
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:27,440
Come on! We'll be too late!

80
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:30,440
- Where are we going? Too late for what?
- Come along. Follow me.

81
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:34,080
- The fields need work in winter too.
- Take it slow.

82
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,800
Before the snow comes,

83
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:38,280
you must plow this entire stretch of land
nice and deep.

84
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,600
Cover the vegetable beds
and wheat rows with straw.

85
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,040
The tools have been used all year,

86
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,680
- so get them repaired too.
- Turn the soil over there again.

87
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,840
- What's real hardship?
- All right.

88
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,520
Let's go.

89
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,560
An empty stomach. That's hardship.

90
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,680
Give the people

91
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:53,000
a decent year and a good harvest,

92
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:55,960
and they'll have smiles on their faces.

93
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:59,200
There are over a thousand mouths to feed

94
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,400
in and around this estate.

95
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,560
Just spend a few days

96
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,920
working in the fields.

97
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:09,280
- I guarantee you have no time to be sad.
- Those lands are done.

98
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:13,600
Food and land are our real lifeblood.

99
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,960
Over here.

100
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,000
Come.

101
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,160
This is hard physical work.

102
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,440
Can you manage it?

103
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:23,800
I've done all kinds of backbreaking work,
but I've never worked the fields.

104
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:26,320
We used to be too poor to own any land.

105
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,400
But I promise you, Grandmother,

106
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,920
I'll work hard.

107
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:33,200
- Good. Get to work.
- We're not done yet.

108
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:34,320
Here, give it to me.

109
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,000
- Bring the ox over!
- Let's move.

110
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,240
All right!

111
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,160
This is good soil.

112
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,400
Turn it over again.

113
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,360
Lady Shou'an.

114
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,560
Lord Lu, what brings you here?

115
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,280
Have your wounds healed?

116
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:14,920
I happened to be passing by.

117
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,160
- Thanks to Imperial Physician Liu,
- Turn it over again.

118
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,160
I'm much better now.

119
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,160
Come.

120
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,520
This one?

121
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,280
Give me a hand.

122
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,600
You shouldn't be doing this.

123
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:25,560
Let me help.

124
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:28,840
No, leading the ox is easy enough.

125
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:32,560
If you really want to help,

126
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:36,160
go plow the field.

127
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,560
All right.

128
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,240
<i>Give it to me.</i>

129
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,880
I wouldn't dare trouble you, My Lord.

130
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,520
Afraid my wounds haven't healed?

131
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,520
- What's this?
- Hold it steady.

132
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,000
- All right.
- Are you worried about me?

133
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,760
Put it here.

134
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:56,560
Since you're so eager to help,
you can handle the plow.

135
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,120
I've seen others drive
the ox and plow at the same time.

136
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,160
With your martial skills,

137
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,960
a little task like this
should be no challenge.

138
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:05,080
I'm flattered.

139
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,480
I won't disappoint you.

140
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:14,560
Surely you know the field
must be cleared before plowing, right?

141
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:17,560
I'll leave the weeds and stones
for you to clear away.

142
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,840
Bring me a basket.

143
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,240
I really am getting old.

144
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,600
I'll leave you two to it.

145
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,640
Work hard. No slacking.

146
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:36,000
Come.

147
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,040
Grandmother…

148
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,800
Over here.

149
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:48,840
Come.

150
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,760
Be careful.

151
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,400
Turn the soil over here again!

152
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:08,600
Some more?

153
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,320
Come.

154
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:13,560
Coming!

155
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,040
Careful!

156
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,800
Be careful.

157
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:24,960
Did you ask Grandmother to come?

158
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:32,720
Lu Zhuo, you said it yourself
that our marriage was a mistake.

159
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:33,800
The sooner we ended it, the better.

160
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,720
I've changed my mind.

161
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:37,600
You're going back on your word?

162
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:42,640
Back then, I risked my life
to clear obstacles for you.

163
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:46,120
You swore you'd repay my kindness.

164
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,960
Now you've turned your back on me.

165
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:52,080
Who's really going back on their word?

166
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,360
You…

167
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:17,600
AS THE SUN RISES

168
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,800
You must be exhausted.

169
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:26,600
Now I really understand
why you don't like Lu Zhuo.

170
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:31,400
While you were there,
he worked so hard at plowing.

171
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:34,640
The moment you left,
he found an excuse and slipped away.

172
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:38,080
My poor old back nearly broke.

173
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,480
You don't believe me?

174
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:45,680
Lu Zhuo is stubborn and keeps his word.

175
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,240
He wouldn't leave a job half done.

176
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:49,160
You're just teasing him.

177
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:51,120
That's right!

178
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:54,160
He really did work hard.

179
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,320
He plowed the field and harrowed it too.

180
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:59,960
Anyone watching would have taken him
for one of our tenant farmers.

181
00:15:00,520 --> 00:15:02,400
Come.

182
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:06,360
Look.

183
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,080
Where did you find such an adorable puppy?

184
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:15,800
Lord Lu gave it to me.

185
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:17,800
Of course it's adorable.

186
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,720
How could you accept a gift from him?

187
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,040
You know perfectly well…

188
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,440
I don't know anything.

189
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:32,680
I just know that a young man
gave me this lovely little dog.

190
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:36,120
Besides, he gave it to me, not you.

191
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,960
What's bothering you?

192
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:41,480
So you'd sell out
your own granddaughter for a puppy?

193
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:42,400
Never.

194
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:47,760
Even a mountain of gold
wouldn't be worth as much as you.

195
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:50,120
As for Lord Lu,

196
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:54,400
don't let him sweet-talk you
into getting back together with him.

197
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,720
What's so great about presiding
over the Lu household?

198
00:15:56,800 --> 00:16:00,520
If you ask me, if you want to marry again,

199
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:03,040
take a husband into your own household.

200
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:05,320
Choose someone young and handsome.

201
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:06,280
Wouldn't that be 100 times better

202
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,520
than marrying
into some great noble family?

203
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,880
I'm in no mood to think about that.

204
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:27,320
Then what are you thinking about?

205
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:28,960
Revenge?

206
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,280
You know?

207
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:37,600
Anyone with eyes can see it.

208
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,880
But don't even think about it.

209
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:44,560
She may lack virtue and intelligence
and be narrow-minded and despicable,

210
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:46,480
but she belongs to the Han clan.

211
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,120
So does the Empress Dowager.

212
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:50,880
For that reason alone,

213
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,800
His Majesty would never
depose the Empress.

214
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,200
My child,

215
00:16:57,200 --> 00:17:01,280
I know you've suffered so many wrongs.

216
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:06,160
But for now, you mustn't think of revenge.

217
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,599
Promise me, will you?

218
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,960
I'll do as you say.

219
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:39,520
ZHUYU ESTATE

220
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:44,120
Lord Lu, that was thoughtful of you.

221
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:46,360
Thank you for coming
to Xianzhuang to let me know.

222
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:50,920
You're wise and worldly, Lady Shou'an.
Wei Rao respects you deeply.

223
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,240
Only you can talk sense into her.

224
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:55,200
I should be thanking you.

225
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,160
I'm not so sure.

226
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,800
Ever since childhood,

227
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:02,000
Rao has endured hardship
and faced so much scorn.

228
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:06,120
Naturally, she's learned
to hide her feelings.

229
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:10,000
I'm afraid she'll say one thing
and do another.

230
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,040
I'll keep an eye on her.

231
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:15,080
Lord Lu, have you really
thought this through?

232
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,840
This won't be an easy path.

233
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,280
You may have nothing to show for it.

234
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:20,600
Turn back while you still can.

235
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:22,360
I wanted to turn back too.

236
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,640
But I struggled with it for so long.

237
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,480
I finally realized

238
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,920
I could no longer turn back.

239
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,400
Luckily, I never leave things half done.

240
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:37,080
However difficult this path may be,
I'll follow it to the end.

241
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,480
Very well.

242
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:41,240
Take good care of her.

243
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,280
Thank you, Grandmother.

244
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:50,680
I'll remember it.

245
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:11,000
My Lady, Lady Li urgently
summoned you to the palace.

246
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,480
I wonder what she wants.

247
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:22,920
Greetings, Your Majesty.

248
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:26,720
Noble Lady Wu'an, you're in quite a hurry.

249
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:27,880
Where are you going?

250
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:31,160
Your Majesty, Lady Li has summoned me.

251
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,440
- I'm on my way…
- Never mind who summoned you.

252
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:35,520
Palace rules dictate
that all titled ladies visiting the palace

253
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:38,200
must first pay
their respects to Her Majesty.

254
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,040
I'm unfamiliar with palace rules.

255
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:46,680
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

256
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:51,000
Perhaps you don't realize
how strict our palace rules are.

257
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:53,960
Even a maid
who accidentally drops a jade cup

258
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:57,120
must have her nose, lips,
and tongue cut off.

259
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:59,560
Entering without
paying your respects to me

260
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:02,040
shows grave disrespect
to the imperial family.

261
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:05,640
Tell me, how should I punish you?

262
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:13,760
<i>I know you've suffered so many wrongs.</i>

263
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:17,440
<i>But for now, you mustn't think of revenge.</i>

264
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,440
I've been rash and ignorant.

265
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:26,280
Please show mercy, Your Majesty.

266
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:27,960
Back then,

267
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:30,160
you were so glib
before the Empress Dowager

268
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,480
with all your clever arguments.

269
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:33,480
At the tournament,
you humiliated me in front of everyone

270
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:34,800
by refusing to marry.

271
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:36,840
How smug and arrogant you were.

272
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:38,680
What's this?

273
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:43,880
One maid dies,
and you're scared out of your wits?

274
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:47,760
Since you're young
and ignorant of the rules,

275
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:50,840
your maid can take your punishment.

276
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,600
Have mercy, Your Majesty! I was wrong!

277
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,640
Have mercy, Your Majesty!

278
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:58,600
- Your Majesty…
- How dare you look Her Majesty in the eye!

279
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,960
Servants are punished
for their masters' mistakes.

280
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:08,360
Even His Majesty
couldn't accuse me of being harsh.

281
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:10,680
Noble Lady Wu'an,

282
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:14,120
wouldn't you agree?

283
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:04,640
I alone am at fault.

284
00:22:06,840 --> 00:22:08,120
My maid knew no better.

285
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:12,680
Please, Your Majesty,
punish me and spare her.

286
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,960
So you do know how to act obediently.

287
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:32,200
You're much more perceptive
than your mother.

288
00:22:32,280 --> 00:22:34,520
Never forget how lowly you are.

289
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:39,440
Know your place, and you'll live longer.

290
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,640
ZHAOYANG PALACE

291
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,560
My mother is worried about you.

292
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:19,720
She wants you to stay with her
in Luoyang for a while.

293
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:23,760
The capital may be prosperous,
but its scenery is no match for Luoyang's.

294
00:23:23,840 --> 00:23:24,680
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

295
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:27,680
If you leave now, you'll still be in time
for the Peony Festival.

296
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:31,720
Everyone in the city, young and old,
will put flowers in their hair.

297
00:23:31,800 --> 00:23:33,960
Music will fill ancient temples
and grand homes.

298
00:23:34,040 --> 00:23:36,840
It'll be far more peaceful
and pleasant than here.

299
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,440
I wish I could go with you.

300
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:40,760
Rao,

301
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,600
I'll have Shuo escort you.

302
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:45,040
Would you like that?

303
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:50,680
There's something
I want to ask Your Ladyship.

304
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:55,360
Since you entered the palace,

305
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:58,320
you've spent over a decade
striving for power.

306
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:01,920
Don't you want to be Empress?

307
00:24:04,320 --> 00:24:06,040
- Rao…
- The one standing in your way

308
00:24:07,320 --> 00:24:08,600
is the Empress Dowager.

309
00:24:12,960 --> 00:24:15,360
The Empress
is the Empress Dowager's niece.

310
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:18,520
Though she's jealous of others' talents
and unfit for her position,

311
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:22,520
she's protected
by the Empress Dowager and the Han clan.

312
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:24,480
Filial piety
is the foundation of our rule.

313
00:24:24,560 --> 00:24:26,440
His Majesty
cannot defy the Empress Dowager,

314
00:24:26,520 --> 00:24:29,280
so the Empress's position is unassailable.

315
00:24:30,040 --> 00:24:31,800
Apart from the Empress,

316
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:37,960
the other powerful consorts
are Lady Zheng and Lady Wang.

317
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:40,880
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

318
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:43,800
<i>Lady Zheng's father and brother</i>
<i>have both served as Grand Commandant.</i>

319
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:46,240
<i>Her family is illustrious</i>
<i>and highly respected.</i>

320
00:24:46,760 --> 00:24:48,000
<i>Her son,</i>

321
00:24:48,080 --> 00:24:50,440
<i>Prince Duan, Liu Shou,</i>
<i>can wield both the pen and the sword.</i>

322
00:24:51,080 --> 00:24:52,960
<i>Compared with</i>
<i>the Empress's adopted son, Prince Jing,</i>

323
00:24:53,040 --> 00:24:54,440
<i>he has greater support</i>
<i>among court officials.</i>

324
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:57,840
<i>His Majesty particularly favors him.</i>

325
00:24:58,560 --> 00:24:59,560
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

326
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,480
<i>The Wang family</i>
<i>is wealthier than any other.</i>

327
00:25:01,560 --> 00:25:02,520
<i>When Lady Wang entered the palace,</i>

328
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:05,440
<i>she gave His Majesty ten copper mines.</i>

329
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:09,200
<i>She spent a billion coins on gifts</i>
<i>to her servants alone.</i>

330
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:11,680
<i>Her son, Prince Fu, Liu Ding,</i>

331
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:14,400
<i>is seeking a wife</i>
<i>whose family can bolster his position.</i>

332
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:17,640
The Empress
has the Empress Dowager's backing.

333
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:22,400
Lady Zheng and Lady Wang
have either noble lineage or vast wealth,

334
00:25:23,120 --> 00:25:25,440
and their sons are highly capable.

335
00:25:25,520 --> 00:25:27,400
None of them is easy to contend with.

336
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:30,520
- I don't want you dragged into this.
- But I already am.

337
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:37,000
Is my sister here?

338
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:38,000
I want to see her.

339
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:38,920
Your…

340
00:25:39,840 --> 00:25:41,360
- Rao!
- You promised me, Your Ladyship,

341
00:25:42,080 --> 00:25:44,200
that I'd never be wronged again.

342
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:47,560
She was only a maid.

343
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:52,200
If you want, I can give you
a hundred or a thousand more.

344
00:25:52,280 --> 00:25:53,960
But you mustn't put yourself in danger.

345
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:55,240
In your eyes,

346
00:25:55,840 --> 00:25:57,800
she was just a lowly maid.

347
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:00,600
But she was the one

348
00:26:01,320 --> 00:26:03,800
who stayed with me through
my most uncertain and difficult days.

349
00:26:04,800 --> 00:26:05,840
To me,

350
00:26:06,560 --> 00:26:08,720
she was closer than you,

351
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:10,960
my own birth mother.

352
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,720
Do you still hate me?

353
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:26,160
Mother.

354
00:26:29,040 --> 00:26:29,920
Mother.

355
00:26:31,800 --> 00:26:34,280
It's getting late.
Rao shouldn't stay in the palace too long.

356
00:26:34,360 --> 00:26:35,680
I'll escort her out.

357
00:26:35,760 --> 00:26:37,880
Tomorrow, you'll escort your grandmother
and your sister to Luoyang.

358
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,360
I'm not going anywhere.

359
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,880
I'm staying in the capital!

360
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,840
Is it really wise to stay here?

361
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,360
Wei Rao, stop right there!

362
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:51,920
I'll settle this score sooner or later.

363
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:54,120
She'll only complicate things by staying.

364
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:55,840
Go persuade her.

365
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:56,960
Make sure she leaves the capital soon.

366
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:05,880
Rao.

367
00:27:05,960 --> 00:27:06,720
BAIHU HALL

368
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:07,760
Rao.

369
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:11,120
Rao, you shouldn't
have argued with Mother.

370
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,360
She only wants what's best for you.

371
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,440
Your Highness,

372
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,720
look at my maid's face
before you say that.

373
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:19,720
Must I really hide
in the countryside near Luoyang

374
00:27:19,800 --> 00:27:21,120
just to escape this danger?

375
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:23,000
If you're angry, take it out on me.

376
00:27:23,080 --> 00:27:24,920
- As for Shou's meals and daily routine…
- How can you blame Mother?

377
00:27:25,680 --> 00:27:27,120
That's no way to show filial piety!

378
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,920
You've always been the one
who's enjoyed Mother's love.

379
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:30,960
I've never had any of it.

380
00:27:31,040 --> 00:27:31,920
Rao?

381
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:34,440
You aren't the one
facing blades and arrows.

382
00:27:35,080 --> 00:27:36,280
No wonder you make it sound so easy.

383
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:38,160
Even if you're jealous,

384
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:40,680
you shouldn't make a scene in public
and damage Mother's reputation.

385
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:42,560
You're coming with me.
I won't let you get away with this. Come!

386
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:44,000
- Liu Shuo!
- Come on!

387
00:27:44,080 --> 00:27:44,800
Let go of me!

388
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,800
- Rao!
- Go check on her.

389
00:27:49,080 --> 00:27:50,280
Rao!

390
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:53,960
Come on. Careful.

391
00:27:55,320 --> 00:27:56,600
Are you hurt?

392
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:58,400
Liu Shuo, how dare you!

393
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,600
No wonder His Majesty
is always scolding you for being rash.

394
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,560
This is disgraceful.

395
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:05,840
I'll be sure to tell His Majesty
and have you properly punished.

396
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,160
My dear,

397
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:18,640
you can't leave the palace
looking like this.

398
00:28:19,360 --> 00:28:21,120
People will talk.

399
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:24,960
Why don't you come to my chambers
and tidy yourself up?

400
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:27,480
Then I'll have your cousin
escort you home.

401
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,000
Come on.

402
00:28:49,040 --> 00:28:50,400
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

403
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:52,600
Of all His Majesty's children,

404
00:28:53,320 --> 00:28:55,800
Liu Shuo is the most unruly.

405
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:59,640
He's like a wild horse,

406
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:02,480
with no talent for letters or arms.

407
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,880
His Majesty has
admonished him time and again,

408
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:05,800
but he never changes.

409
00:29:06,840 --> 00:29:10,280
You are a forgiving girl.

410
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:13,160
Don't hold it against him.

411
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:16,280
He and I were born of the same mother,

412
00:29:16,800 --> 00:29:18,840
yet my cousin Shu cares for me more.

413
00:29:20,120 --> 00:29:22,560
I thought that
once I found my birth mother,

414
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:24,200
I'd have someone to protect me.

415
00:29:25,200 --> 00:29:29,000
I never imagined
she'd refuse to stand up for me too.

416
00:29:29,760 --> 00:29:32,120
Perhaps Lady Li has her reasons.

417
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:39,800
Your cousin has told me
the whole story of your birth.

418
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,160
What I don't understand is,

419
00:29:42,760 --> 00:29:45,320
are wealth and power really worth so much?

420
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:49,880
How could a mother
bear to see her own daughter

421
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:52,720
treated so cruelly?

422
00:29:53,520 --> 00:29:55,280
She's far too heartless.

423
00:29:55,360 --> 00:29:57,720
If I had a sweet,
lovely daughter like you,

424
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:02,720
why, I could never love her enough.

425
00:30:03,280 --> 00:30:04,720
I could only dream of having one.

426
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:07,160
From now on,

427
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:10,800
if anyone wrongs you,
come straight to my chambers.

428
00:30:11,400 --> 00:30:13,440
I can at least offer you some comfort.

429
00:30:25,560 --> 00:30:28,000
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

430
00:30:28,080 --> 00:30:29,080
Careful.

431
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:31,560
My Lord.

432
00:30:33,320 --> 00:30:34,560
You must be tired.

433
00:30:36,080 --> 00:30:37,400
- Take care.
- See you next time.

434
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:38,800
Who was visiting?

435
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:40,680
Someone from the Qi family,
the Marquis of Pingxi's household.

436
00:30:42,520 --> 00:30:43,720
Fresh vegetables!

437
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:44,640
Please make way.

438
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:46,160
Get your fresh greens!

439
00:30:47,360 --> 00:30:49,360
- Here you are, sir.
- Thanks.

440
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:52,240
What? He really went?

441
00:30:52,320 --> 00:30:54,360
Of course. Plenty of people saw him.

442
00:30:55,800 --> 00:30:57,280
Good!

443
00:30:58,840 --> 00:30:59,680
Good!

444
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:00,600
BENEVOLENCE SPREADS FAR AND WIDE

445
00:31:10,360 --> 00:31:12,720
What's made you so happy, Grandmother?

446
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,120
You're beaming.

447
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:20,320
Wanniang, tell your dear son
why the Qi family came to visit.

448
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:24,400
The Marquis of Pingxi wishes to marry

449
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:26,160
Noble Lady Wu'an on Zhongkai's behalf.

450
00:31:26,240 --> 00:31:30,240
Out of respect for the long friendship
between our families,

451
00:31:30,320 --> 00:31:33,440
they came to sound us out first.

452
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:34,920
What?

453
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:36,800
Don't worry. Actually…

454
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:39,400
Actually, they were worrying over nothing.

455
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:42,080
Lu Zhuo is so magnanimous.

456
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:46,280
Even if Wei Rao marries General Qi,
he'll have no objection.

457
00:31:46,360 --> 00:31:50,600
After all, one is the ex-wife of an
convenience marriage just to bring luck.

458
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:53,720
The other is a brother-in-arms
who's faced death alongside him.

459
00:31:53,800 --> 00:31:55,280
If they tie the knot…

460
00:31:55,360 --> 00:31:56,520
Did you agree to it too, Grandmother?

461
00:31:57,280 --> 00:32:00,200
As long as Wei Rao is willing,

462
00:32:00,280 --> 00:32:04,400
even Lady Li would have no objection.

463
00:32:04,480 --> 00:32:07,320
Who am I, an outsider, to have a say?

464
00:32:10,360 --> 00:32:11,640
Zhuo! Lu Zhuo!

465
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,040
Where are you going?

466
00:32:14,840 --> 00:32:17,320
Mother, why must you tease him?

467
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:21,240
When the Qi family came to sound us out,
didn't you send them away?

468
00:32:21,320 --> 00:32:22,400
You never agreed to anything.

469
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:26,520
He acts so hard-hearted
and stubborn in public,

470
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:28,680
then secretly goes and plows her fields.

471
00:32:28,760 --> 00:32:30,200
Even kept it from his own family.

472
00:32:30,280 --> 00:32:32,560
Look how anxious he is now.

473
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:34,640
Serves him right!

474
00:32:37,000 --> 00:32:37,840
Bravo!

475
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:53,880
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

476
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:55,720
You may all leave.

477
00:32:55,800 --> 00:32:57,640
CAISHU HALL

478
00:32:58,280 --> 00:32:59,600
Why have they stopped?

479
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:04,560
Even the finest performance is pointless
if no one appreciates it.

480
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:10,280
Wei Rao, what's troubling you
that you can't tell me?

481
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:19,480
A lowly night-soil woman
is now Noble Lady Wu'an,

482
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:23,040
with a generous stipend and a fief.

483
00:33:24,120 --> 00:33:25,840
It's what so many people dream of.

484
00:33:27,120 --> 00:33:28,840
What more could I want?

485
00:33:37,360 --> 00:33:38,200
Wei Rao,

486
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:41,240
I want to marry you.

487
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:45,160
You…

488
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:46,640
I know, to protect yourself,

489
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:49,320
you've had to keep
both Lu Zhuo and me on your side.

490
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:53,200
I'm happy to help you,

491
00:33:53,280 --> 00:33:55,680
but I wish I have met you earlier.

492
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:58,040
Alone at midnight,

493
00:33:58,120 --> 00:34:00,000
I used to lie awake,
thinking over and over.

494
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:03,640
If you truly loved each other
and were truly husband and wife,

495
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:07,480
however much it hurt,

496
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:09,960
I could hide my feelings.

497
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:12,600
But he actually let you go.

498
00:34:13,239 --> 00:34:15,400
Clearly, you meant nothing to him.

499
00:34:16,239 --> 00:34:18,320
Only then, I feel I can confess
what is in my heart.

500
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:24,800
General Qi, you don't really know me.

501
00:34:24,880 --> 00:34:28,440
Before I met you,
I didn't even know myself.

502
00:34:30,239 --> 00:34:32,040
I foolishly pictured my future wife,

503
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:36,800
hoping she'd be gentle, virtuous,
poised, and gracious.

504
00:34:37,560 --> 00:34:39,040
But once I met you,

505
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,639
I can no longer picture her
as anyone else.

506
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:49,320
What if I say no?

507
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:54,280
If you say yes,
I'll do everything I can to keep you safe.

508
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,600
If you say no,

509
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,640
it means I haven't done enough.

510
00:34:58,200 --> 00:35:00,120
I'll try a hundred,
even a thousand times harder.

511
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:06,160
Even when my hair turns gray
and my teeth loosen with age,

512
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,520
I'll be waiting for you to say yes.

513
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:27,320
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

514
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:38,280
<i>Rao,</i>

515
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:40,320
<i>the proprieties come before everything.</i>

516
00:35:40,840 --> 00:35:42,960
<i>Even I have to bow to them.</i>

517
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:45,320
<i>You must do the same.</i>

518
00:35:47,680 --> 00:35:49,200
<i>Never forget how lowly you are.</i>

519
00:35:50,520 --> 00:35:53,720
<i>Know your place, and you'll live longer.</i>

520
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:55,560
The proprieties?

521
00:35:57,520 --> 00:36:00,040
I know nothing of them.

522
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:04,920
All I know is debts must be paid,
and murderers must die.

523
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:07,800
She holds human life so cheap.

524
00:36:09,120 --> 00:36:11,360
She's unfit to be Empress.

525
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:16,600
However high she sits as Empress,

526
00:36:17,240 --> 00:36:21,440
I'll drag her down from her throne.

527
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:25,000
It's Jinzi.

528
00:36:25,080 --> 00:36:26,040
It's running all over the place again.

529
00:36:29,520 --> 00:36:30,360
Bring it here.

530
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:34,840
Yes.

531
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:44,600
Come out!

532
00:36:44,680 --> 00:36:45,640
Jinzi!

533
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:47,040
CAISHU HALL

534
00:36:47,120 --> 00:36:48,360
Jinzi?

535
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:51,440
Jinzi?

536
00:36:52,640 --> 00:36:53,800
Come out, you wretched dog!

537
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:55,080
What's wrong?

538
00:36:55,600 --> 00:36:57,560
That stupid, filthy dog
ran off with my earring.

539
00:36:57,640 --> 00:36:58,880
Go catch it.

540
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:00,800
Lord Lu gave that dog to Her Ladyship.

541
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:01,840
She adores it.

542
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:02,760
How can you…?

543
00:37:02,840 --> 00:37:04,160
Don't use Her Ladyship's name
to pressure me.

544
00:37:04,920 --> 00:37:05,880
All of you, go look for the dog.

545
00:37:05,960 --> 00:37:06,920
Catch that dog right now!

546
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,720
That wretched dog.

547
00:37:11,080 --> 00:37:11,920
Gejin!

548
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:13,000
Come out, you wretched dog!

549
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:14,800
Jinzi!

550
00:37:32,680 --> 00:37:34,320
How dare you sneak in here
so late at night?

551
00:37:46,160 --> 00:37:47,000
What?

552
00:37:48,120 --> 00:37:51,520
Qi Zhongkai can visit, but I can't?

553
00:37:52,040 --> 00:37:52,880
How dare you!

554
00:38:33,400 --> 00:38:35,360
Guards!

555
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:45,920
Everyone knows
Lord Lu is honorable and upright,

556
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:47,880
a true gentleman.

557
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:49,240
Yet you sneaked
into a lady's chamber at night.

558
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:51,760
Aren't you afraid
it'll ruin your reputation?

559
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:57,320
Why are you laughing?
Have you lost your mind?

560
00:39:02,640 --> 00:39:05,000
Go ahead. Call everyone here.

561
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:07,200
Let the whole world know

562
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:10,920
Noble Lady Wu'an and her former husband
are having a midnight tryst.

563
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,960
- You…!
- Your Ladyship!

564
00:39:14,080 --> 00:39:15,160
Your Ladyship!

565
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:16,720
Your Ladyship!

566
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:19,200
Your Ladyship, where's the intruder?

567
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:24,280
It's night, and the candlelight is dim.

568
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:25,680
My eyes played tricks on me.

569
00:39:25,760 --> 00:39:27,440
I mistook a tree's shadow for a person.

570
00:39:27,520 --> 00:39:28,520
All is well. You may leave.

571
00:39:29,160 --> 00:39:30,000
- Yes.
- Yes.

572
00:39:33,240 --> 00:39:35,680
Lu Zhuo, why won't you leave me alone?

573
00:39:38,640 --> 00:39:42,920
I've come to talk
to Your Ladyship about a deal.

574
00:39:44,400 --> 00:39:45,240
What kind of deal?

575
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:48,000
The Empress schemed
to force you into marriage

576
00:39:48,080 --> 00:39:48,960
and killed your beloved maid.

577
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:52,360
Knowing you, you must hate her bitterly

578
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,520
and be desperate for revenge.

579
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:01,400
Go on.

580
00:40:03,680 --> 00:40:05,720
Han Liao conspired with the Huta.

581
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:06,880
He leaked military secrets,

582
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:10,480
nearly killing me
and costing me soldiers and officers.

583
00:40:11,480 --> 00:40:13,280
I won't rest until he's dead.

584
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:18,680
If the Han clan is our common enemy,

585
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:40,360
why shouldn't we work together?

586
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:44,960
Qi Zhongkai can't help you
achieve what you want.

587
00:40:46,040 --> 00:40:48,240
He still answers
to his father and elder brother.

588
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:51,160
Neither in the Marquis
of Pingxi's household nor in the army

589
00:40:52,640 --> 00:40:54,240
does he have the final say.

590
00:40:55,760 --> 00:40:57,000
I'm different.

591
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,320
In all the world,

592
00:41:07,120 --> 00:41:09,560
I'm the only one who knows what you want.

593
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,200
And I'm the only one

594
00:41:14,240 --> 00:41:16,120
who can help you get it,

595
00:41:19,240 --> 00:41:20,080
Wei Rao.

596
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:23,640
Why?

597
00:41:24,400 --> 00:41:25,960
Don't hesitate any longer.

598
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,680
I have everything you want.

599
00:41:30,720 --> 00:41:33,520
If you need me, just come to me.

600
00:41:35,600 --> 00:41:37,040
I'd do it gladly.

601
00:41:40,720 --> 00:41:43,680
You came all this way
just to tell me that?

602
00:41:46,080 --> 00:41:47,320
I had to.

603
00:41:48,160 --> 00:41:50,000
I was afraid someone
would offer you a little favor,

604
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,920
and you'd run off with him.

605
00:41:55,240 --> 00:41:56,080
There.

606
00:41:56,600 --> 00:41:57,520
It's your turn to choose.

607
00:42:13,600 --> 00:42:15,200
Do I even have a choice?

608
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:44,720
Where on earth is it hiding?

609
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:47,680
That wretched dog.

610
00:43:04,320 --> 00:43:05,320
Chilan.

611
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:07,720
Have you found Jinzi?

612
00:43:08,240 --> 00:43:09,080
Chilan!

613
00:43:12,280 --> 00:43:13,200
Gejin.

614
00:43:13,960 --> 00:43:15,960
What's wrong? You look so pale.

615
00:43:16,560 --> 00:43:18,800
I'm fine. I'm just terrified of the dark.

616
00:43:18,880 --> 00:43:20,240
Have you seen Jinzi?

617
00:43:20,320 --> 00:43:22,200
I thought I heard Jinzi just now.

618
00:43:23,120 --> 00:43:25,160
But then it was gone again.

619
00:43:26,000 --> 00:43:27,040
Right.

620
00:43:28,720 --> 00:43:29,560
Gejin.

621
00:43:48,920 --> 00:43:49,960
Jinzi!

622
00:43:51,480 --> 00:43:52,360
Jinzi?

623
00:44:27,840 --> 00:44:30,040
<i>How do you propose we form this alliance?</i>

624
00:44:30,120 --> 00:44:32,360
You're fickle and cast people aside
once they've served their purpose.

625
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:34,560
I can't trust you, unless…

626
00:44:34,640 --> 00:44:35,800
Unless what?

627
00:44:35,880 --> 00:44:39,880
Unless we remarry
and become husband and wife again.

628
00:44:43,800 --> 00:44:46,080
Then you'll have to prove

629
00:44:47,520 --> 00:44:49,080
what you're capable of first.

630
00:44:55,480 --> 00:44:56,560
Where's Chilan?

631
00:44:58,920 --> 00:45:01,760
Oh, that girl. The day's just started,

632
00:45:01,840 --> 00:45:03,200
and she's already off
somewhere shirking her duties.

633
00:45:04,640 --> 00:45:05,720
She's not like that.

634
00:45:07,200 --> 00:45:08,200
You needn't attend to me.

635
00:45:08,800 --> 00:45:09,960
Go and look for Chilan.

636
00:45:10,560 --> 00:45:11,400
- Yes.
- Yes.

637
00:45:19,600 --> 00:45:20,840
I'll go at once.

638
00:45:30,960 --> 00:45:33,640
I remember giving you
a gold necklace set with sapphires.

639
00:45:34,160 --> 00:45:36,040
Later, when you pawned your jewelry,

640
00:45:36,120 --> 00:45:37,680
you picked out that piece
and returned it to me.

641
00:45:38,200 --> 00:45:39,400
I thought perhaps you didn't like it.

642
00:45:39,480 --> 00:45:43,120
So I had a finer one made for you.

643
00:45:44,040 --> 00:45:45,080
See if you like this one.

644
00:45:46,120 --> 00:45:47,720
General Qi, the truth is…

645
00:45:47,800 --> 00:45:49,840
If you're going to turn it down,
please don't say it.

646
00:45:50,440 --> 00:45:52,200
If you want a husband
to join your household,

647
00:45:52,280 --> 00:45:53,880
I have an elder brother,

648
00:45:53,960 --> 00:45:56,320
so marrying into your family
would be no problem.

649
00:45:57,440 --> 00:45:59,240
Lu Zhuo is the Duke's heir, though.

650
00:45:59,320 --> 00:46:00,160
Can he do that?

651
00:46:00,240 --> 00:46:01,880
Such groveling, General Qi.

652
00:46:01,960 --> 00:46:03,360
Aren't you afraid
your father will die of anger?

653
00:46:07,320 --> 00:46:09,880
I knew you'd be scheming
behind my back again.

654
00:46:09,960 --> 00:46:12,360
Your Ladyship, don't fall for his tricks.

655
00:46:12,920 --> 00:46:14,200
He's been like this since childhood.

656
00:46:14,720 --> 00:46:17,160
Now, he seems modest and easygoing,

657
00:46:17,240 --> 00:46:19,600
but behind closed doors,
he's full of tricks and schemes.

658
00:46:19,680 --> 00:46:20,800
Behind closed doors?

659
00:46:21,320 --> 00:46:22,240
As if you haven't played
your share of tricks.

660
00:46:22,840 --> 00:46:24,400
I'm honest and aboveboard.

661
00:46:25,080 --> 00:46:26,160
What tricks have I played?

662
00:46:34,320 --> 00:46:37,680
Do you think Wei Rao is that shallow?

663
00:46:40,840 --> 00:46:42,000
You're one to talk.

664
00:46:42,080 --> 00:46:43,560
Don't think I don't know
you've been watching her,

665
00:46:43,640 --> 00:46:44,560
trying to win her over by staying close.

666
00:46:45,320 --> 00:46:46,200
You can't hide it from me.

667
00:46:46,840 --> 00:46:47,680
Your Ladyship!

668
00:46:50,520 --> 00:46:52,080
Your Ladyship,
something terrible has happened.

669
00:46:59,560 --> 00:47:00,520
Her Ladyship is here.

670
00:47:07,440 --> 00:47:09,440
Chilan!

671
00:47:12,440 --> 00:47:13,560
Chilan…

672
00:47:15,040 --> 00:47:15,880
What happened?

673
00:47:15,960 --> 00:47:18,000
Someone fetching water
found her in the river this morning.

674
00:47:18,800 --> 00:47:21,160
She may have slipped and fallen in.

675
00:47:22,400 --> 00:47:24,120
Pull her out of the way.

676
00:47:28,040 --> 00:47:30,040
Chilan!

677
00:47:44,880 --> 00:47:45,880
Nothing between her fingers.

678
00:47:46,560 --> 00:47:48,800
- No sand or waterweeds.
- Nothing in her mouth either.

679
00:47:49,960 --> 00:47:51,160
What does that mean?

680
00:47:52,480 --> 00:47:55,200
If she'd been alive when she fell in,
she would have struggled,

681
00:47:55,280 --> 00:47:58,000
and there'd usually be weeds or sand
lodged between her fingers.

682
00:47:58,720 --> 00:47:59,600
Unless…

683
00:48:00,560 --> 00:48:02,520
Unless someone threw her
into the river after she was dead.

684
00:48:12,160 --> 00:48:13,760
What happened here?

685
00:48:13,840 --> 00:48:14,720
Who did this?

686
00:48:14,800 --> 00:48:15,600
Who could've done this?

687
00:48:15,680 --> 00:48:19,080
Without my permission,
no one here is to leave.

688
00:48:19,160 --> 00:48:20,840
How could this happen?

689
00:48:20,920 --> 00:48:22,120
Who did this?

690
00:48:22,720 --> 00:48:24,480
- How could she end up here?
- Right.

691
00:48:28,880 --> 00:48:29,920
It's Jinzi.

692
00:48:50,640 --> 00:48:51,760
What's wrong?

693
00:48:51,840 --> 00:48:54,280
That silly girl lost the jade bracelet
Your Ladyship gave her.

694
00:48:54,360 --> 00:48:55,440
She cried all last night.

695
00:48:55,520 --> 00:48:56,920
How embarrassing.

696
00:49:01,160 --> 00:49:02,200
Here.

697
00:49:02,280 --> 00:49:04,240
This is to replace it. Don't cry.

698
00:49:05,240 --> 00:49:06,080
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

699
00:49:07,800 --> 00:49:09,040
It belonged to Chilan.

700
00:49:09,800 --> 00:49:11,080
Why is it near the cellar?

701
00:49:11,720 --> 00:49:13,800
Bring me all the workers who've been
digging the cellar over the past ten days.

702
00:49:14,360 --> 00:49:15,560
- Yes.
- Yes.

703
00:49:45,200 --> 00:49:47,160
I'm innocent, My Lord!

704
00:49:52,160 --> 00:49:53,120
It was you?

705
00:49:53,200 --> 00:49:54,440
It wasn't me.

706
00:49:54,520 --> 00:49:55,800
It really wasn't me!

707
00:49:58,560 --> 00:50:00,600
I'm innocent, My Lord!

708
00:50:00,680 --> 00:50:01,520
How dare he?

709
00:50:01,600 --> 00:50:03,240
How could anyone do such a thing?

710
00:50:03,320 --> 00:50:04,760
How could he commit such an murder?

711
00:50:04,840 --> 00:50:06,240
How could he do that?

712
00:50:06,320 --> 00:50:08,840
Lu Zhuo, I leave this man to you.

713
00:50:08,920 --> 00:50:11,040
Whatever methods you use,

714
00:50:12,080 --> 00:50:13,520
before sunset today,

715
00:50:15,120 --> 00:50:17,960
I want to know why he killed Chilan,
who'd done nothing wrong.

716
00:50:18,560 --> 00:50:19,480
There's no need to wait till sunset.

717
00:50:19,560 --> 00:50:20,400
- He was nice fellow, but why?
- Indeed.

718
00:50:20,480 --> 00:50:22,880
- I'll have your answer within an hour.
- How could he do such a thing?

719
00:52:34,080 --> 00:52:36,640
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
